  "title": "TC Energy to host fourth quarter 2025 conference call on Feb. 13",
  "summary": "CALGARY, Alberta, Jan. 22, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- News Release – TC Energy Corporation (TSX, NYSE: TRP) (TC Energy or the Company) will hold a teleconference and webcast on Friday, Feb. 13, 2026, to discuss its fourth quarter financial results. François Poirier, TC Energy President and Chief Executive Officer, Sean O’Donnell, Executive Vice-President and Chief Financial Officer, and other members of the executive leadership team will discuss the financial results and Company developments at 6:30...",
